      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_comparing_to_primates",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "A well-documented racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by equating them with monkeys or apes, implying inferiority, animalism, and lack of humanity. This stereotype has been used historically and in modern media to justify discrimination and violence against Black individuals.",
