      "label": "Racist Intent: Trivializing Racism",
      "description": "The underlying intent of the meme is to undermine the seriousness of racial injustice by suggesting that racial differences are irrelevant or that Black people are 'the same' as white people in a degrading, animalistic way, thereby perpetuating harmful racial stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_47bb6560"
