      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e2d4a0e1",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that may be exposed to or familiar with racist stereotypes, particularly those involving the comparison of Black people to primates. It targets individuals who might be influenced by or sympathetic to dehumanizing racial metaphors, and who may be seeking to trivialize racism by suggesting racial sameness in a degrading way. The audience is likely to be those who are not aware of or do not challenge the harmful implications of such imagery and text, and who may be part of communities that perpetuate or normalize such racist tropes.",
